1","revenue":7137920000.0,"op_margin":0.156681,"eps":3.14,"fcf":553818000.0,"owner_fcf":585660000.0,"roic":0.100935,"roe":null,"shares":104243000.0,"net_income":327334000.0}],"hist_source":"SEC 10-K","hist_currency":"USD","profile":{"longBusinessSummary":"Wynn Resorts, Limited designs, develops, and operates integrated resorts. It operates in four segments: Wynn Palace, Wynn Macau, Las Vegas Operations, and Encore Boston Harbor. The Wynn Palace segment operates casino space, private gaming salons, and sky casinos; a luxury hotel tower with suites and villas, as well as a health club, spa, salon, and pool; food and beverage outlets; retail space; meeting and convention space; and a performance lake, an immersive entertainment center, Western and Asian art displays, and a gondola ride. Its Wynn Macau segment operates casino space, private gaming salons, sky casinos, and a poker room; luxury hotel towers with health clubs, spas, a salon, and a pool; food and beverage outlets; retail space; meeting and convention space; a performance lake; and a rotunda show featuring Chinese zodiac-inspired ceilings. The Las Vegas Operations segment operates casino space, private gaming salons, a sky casino, a poker room, and a race and sports book; a luxury hotel tower with suites, villas, swimming pools, private cabanas, full-service spas and salons, and a wedding chapel; food and beverage outlets; meeting and convention space; retail space; a golf course; nightclubs; a beach club; and theaters. Its Encore Boston Harbor segment operates casino space, private and high-limit gaming areas, and a sports book; a luxury hotel tower with suites, a spa, and a salon; food and beverage outlets; a nightclub; retail space; meeting and convention space; a waterfront park; floral displays; and water shuttle services. Wynn Resorts, Limited was incorporated in 2002 and is based in Las Vegas, Nevada.","fullTimeEmployees":28500,"city":"Las Vegas","country":"United States","website":"https://www.wynnresorts.com","industry":"Resorts & Casinos","sector":"Consumer Cyclical"},"news":[{"title":"MGM vs Wynn: operating scale against valuation upside","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/mgm-vs-wynn-operating-scale-142454185.html","publisher":"Investing.com","date":"2026-11-16"},{"title":"They Were the Indispensable CEOs—Until They Weren’t","link":"https://www.wsj.com/business/they-were-the-indispensable-ceosuntil-they-werent-1bb8a52c?siteid=yhoof2&yptr=yahoo","publisher":"The Wall Street Journal","date":"2026-11-13"},{"title":"Wynn: 3 Key Takeaways for Long-Term Investors","link":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/takeaways/2026/11/09/wynn-3-key-takeaways-for-long-term-investors/","publisher":"Motley Fool","date":"2026-11-09"},{"title":"Wynn Resorts Q3 Earnings Call Highlights","link":"https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/transcript-wynn-resorts-q3-earnings-call-highlights-2026-11-06/?utm_source=yahoofinance&utm_medium=yahoofinance","publisher":"MarketBeat","date":"2026-11-06"},{"title":"Wynn Resorts' Q3 Earnings Miss Estimates on Weak Gaming Results","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/wynn-resorts-q3-earnings-miss-154600563.html","publisher":"Zacks","date":"2026-11-06"},{"title":"Wynn reaches deal with striking Boston union workers, posts Q3 results","link":"https://www.hoteldive.com/news/wynn-encore-boston-harbor-workers-agreement-q3-2026-earnings/873989/","publisher":"Hotel Dive","date":"2026-11-06"}],"info_date":"2026-11-20"}